<SEC>
<SCN>03 30 00</SCN>
<STL>CAST-IN-PLACE CONCRETE</STL>
<DTE>08/26</DTE>
<PRA>USACE</PRA>
<PRT>
<TTL>PART 1 GENERAL</TTL>
<SPT>
<TTL>REFERENCES</TTL>
<REF><RID>ACI 318</RID><RTL>Building Code Requirements for Structural Concrete, 2019</RTL></REF>
<REF><RID>ASTM C33</RID><RTL>Standard Specification for Concrete Aggregates</RTL></REF>
</SPT>
<SPT>
<TTL>SUBMITTALS</TTL>
<TXT>Government approval is required for <SUB>SD-03 Product Data</SUB> mix designs.</TXT>
</SPT>
<SPT>
<TTL>DESIGN REQUIREMENTS</TTL>
<NTE>Specifier: Choose compressive strength and delete unused options.</NTE>
<TXT>Provide [cast-in-place][precast] concrete with a 28-day compressive strength of [30 MPa][4000 psi].</TXT>
<TXT>Design shall conform to <RID>ACI 318</RID>.</TXT>
<TXT>Do not use <RID>ACI 301</RID> unless added to the Reference Article.</TXT>
<TXT>Coordinate vapor barrier with <SRF>07 26 00</SRF>.</TXT>
</SPT>
</PRT>
<PRT>
<TTL>PART 2 PRODUCTS</TTL>
<SPT>
<TTL>AGGREGATE</TTL>
<TXT>Fine and coarse aggregate shall conform to <RID>ASTM C33</RID>.</TXT>
</SPT>
</PRT>
<PRT>
<TTL>PART 3 EXECUTION</TTL>
<SPT>
<TTL>PLACING</TTL>
<TXT>Place concrete continuously between construction joints.</TXT>
</SPT>
</PRT>
</SEC>
